    <string name="aon_message">In order to tell whether multiple people are looking at the screen, this feature will access the front camera when a floating notification is displayed. The collected images are only used for on-device analysis of the number of people looking at the screen. When multiple people are detected, notification content will be hidden by default.</string>
    <string name="aon_message_owner">"When this feature is on, the front camera will check who's looking at the screen when a notification arrives. If the phone detects that you're not the only one viewing the screen, it will automatically hide the notification content. All image and face data is processed locally on your device and never uploaded to the cloud."</string>
